 ict 10 Bayview Family Summit! The This Is Your City: Family Summit Series 
 invites families\, caregivers\, young people\, and community members from 
 across San Francisco to help shape the future of our city. Saturday\, Dec.
  5\, 2026\, 11:00 a.m. – 1:30 p.m. Southeast Community Center \, ● 155
 0 Evans Ave\, SF\, CA 94124 Free food\, childcare\, and interpretation are
  provided. Please note all interpretation requests must be made 48 hours o
 r more prior to the Family Summit. Who should attend? Everyone is welcome.
  This event highlights District 10\, but you can attend any Family Summit 
 that fits your schedule. Why are we gathering? The Family Summit Series is
  part of San Francisco’s first Citywide Community Needs Assessment. Thro
 ugh conversations with families across the city\, we’re learning what ma
 tters most to children\, youth\, young adults\, and families. What we lear
 n will help improve future planning\, programs\, and services. Whether you
